@@s020 Closest pair → divide and conquer with strip: O(n log n). Phrase: <i>"Sort by x; split with a vertical line; recurse on both halves getting δ; check the strip of width 2δ, sorted by y. T(n) = 2T(n/2) + O(n)."</i>
